    "title": "5 with UM ties arrested in FBI raid appear in federal court hours later - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sam Jane ,\n10 hours ago DETROIT, MI — Five of the eight people arrested Wednesday, June 10 in connection with pro-Palestinian advocacy at the University of Michigan made their initial appearances in federal court later Wednesday. Four of them will remain in custody until at least 1 p.m. on Friday, June 10, at which... Read full article",
